    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f813aaae3fd3ca94942b4cdf",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喜欢旅行带回来的伴手礼吗？\n不过对你来说，\n“我”才是最棒的那份大礼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2b9856d0dd38a955839a9a348d9d852a4e24e27ca923e6eeb37d21b2955c66d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6f19fbefcddec4c03d06c31",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那，我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "988ef158a4fdab34c73d3cb5b5b067300841192c9eea8ca1561d9439d4c92d1e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "100000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/100000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb0741b7ba1fe8f36a3cb643",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我回来啦～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef3dcf02aed6bad3606301d1383da46bc6b743d218a4ae27da93cd089795e59e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "100001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/100001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2a1149f6ecc53955d7f0fad",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还会在这所学园待上一阵子吧。\n我很喜欢你给我的那些刺激。\n那么，今天要做什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8a36a637d74e9717f2f920d056532003d1dfc02df11f37c230cb06626d05d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cce68989cbbd4945eea4b5c2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，我也和你去了不少地方呢。\n这样的话，下次……\n干脆试着回一趟彼此的老家吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5562552210914f7223b4d896f5ad6d4eaa387d75918fe91d6936d3903d173bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa638c91b78e7462fe031da2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每个国家新年的气氛都不一样。\n虽然以前总是到处奔走……\n但和熟悉的面孔一起迎接新年，也不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e611f4ca3e83e4298e7c9202ec7d58bbf4fb2e0164fe2e798f20843b151a7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d150866a661b5e7168e2617",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，喜欢巧克力吗？\n黄金船刚才送来的。\n……味道挺刺激的吧？待会一起吃吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "932495ed9c93ceaca68e968ef3bda627ea48869eb8e89676f9409b9dc2c64c0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d6fc8afec1ced534ebdc6d1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到处都是甜甜的味道……大家都喜欢呢。\n我倒是无法理解。要是你想要的话……\n牵起我的手，把我带走就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9a9d1ee20ee8c10d6020533ab1854059a70c664d5765836a9f58d1aeb956832",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c85556092dd34574b1474fa",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "众人的愿望，汇聚成了璀璨星河……。\n呐，你会祈祷什么？\n我祈求……温柔的寂静。献给所有的夜晚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9566f6f0c543c99ea193e57f91955aac291b164217d940ef856b3a22cd8e0cdb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e932057733a5d6e95a05f603",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船她们好像正兴致勃勃的。\n你也要小心别被她们恶作剧了。\n我？我什么都不会做的。……大概吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb555ddfce7207ccb0818cc1f6b012619f13ef41d2da136bc818d90dec4dfbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6be90a3ffa6f06c2241d40f4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这段时期梦旅难得地固执呢……\n似乎无论如何都想聚在一起度过\n真是个可爱的家伙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b5f0e5b3f39c622fdd7d9f69dfa8a29163a2cde19238032f38e7c490c3b607",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06ebf7b4a7a1d54803db43d7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神圣之夜，应有神圣之梦……\n偶尔也让我们安静地，聊聊天吧。\n咖啡，我会泡好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "575148711b24357f2cd05a9ca8ff32fb82f64b5f21b4c657f66182a227c76f37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be76f6074c4b98df71d2fc4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是我们的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa9036081a7f482faf55dbd165feddb264071e3493ed3b9588d8f35fee1b2ce2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/1001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e61099e4714207c831a13486",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这一年，是场似长实短的旅行呢。\n稍作休息，就要前往下一个时光了。\n你到那时候……也会在吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5f6964871a831af2daee4ad487eb4da050531f9dfbbca9ac48d2fe5a1e8daf0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c75b9055ded2404172359a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\n……嗯？今天是你的生日吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a37cd41ad51f2384439bc623bffec57d3c68fbf9d39f951c83884ca8cb08344f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:807bd41dc21980fe290b6c83",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你降生、活到现在，\n不断选择自己的道路……此刻就在这里。\n那一路留下怎样的辙印……都很美哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce95e7bb191efb54f7ee5e175536f48908bf39eddb10a9726a099e4595310d4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2afb4a6a1cbfeb31d448505d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天计划被塞得格外满呢……\n真是忙个不停啊。\n要不要干脆直接消失一阵子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ab0faab0d932d5e277cd0d81c3a19d3636f64e391bc124bf779d7e7859e2cd9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cd443844dfe6f98eba1a019",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本来想出去走走的……算了。\n毕竟你特意来见我了。\n那我就……老实被你抓住吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d37106b0dbf8c6e1ed962e4b22fd14e448730aee85714e769827ba82a9be82f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1135/10014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b7f95d2dc0c4eefa9a7082",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "收到通知了哦。\n要不要确认，就随你便了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f40497cd6ae55b89d39f4f61f1f10dbada4f21c430c2261074df021b77030827",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
